  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Because acidic character <math><mo>&#8733;</mo></math> stability of conjugate base (Anion)<br /><br />(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CH</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo></mover><mtext>anion</mtext><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mtext>ve&#160; on&#160;</mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></math><br /><br />(b) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo></mover><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mtext>ve&#160; on&#160;</mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mtext>&#160;and&#160;</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mtext>&#160;of&#160;</mtext><mo>&#8722;</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></math><br /><br />(c) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mtext>ve&#160;on&#160;</mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></math><br /><br />Acidic character order <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><mi>CH</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo></mover></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub></munder><mo>&#62;</mo><munder><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mtext>with</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mtext>&#160; of&#160;</mtext><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></munder><mo>&#62;</mo><munder><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo></mover></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msub></munder></math><br />&nbsp;</p></blockquote>",
